# The built binary at the repo root. The leading slash is load-bearing: a bare
# `onsetter` also matches cmd/onsetter/, which silently excluded the entire
# command directory from the first commit.
/onsetter
*.bak-*

# Session handoff/review notes another Claude Code session drops at the repo
# root — conversation-trace prose ("written by a session", private local
# paths, competitor internals) that belongs nowhere near a public commit.
# Named explicitly rather than by a broad glob, so a real future root-level
# doc doesn't get silently swallowed by the same pattern.
/HANDOFF-marketplace-submission.md
/FEEDBACK-2026-09-03.md
/CC-INSIGHTS-2026-09-03.md
